{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"AC4 store scan (signed PASS over a plan-review finding with DET P1 `no standard ## Acceptance Criteria checklist`): excluding the reported `classical-grey-ayeaye`, I found these other tickets with nearby plan-review SIGNATURE events and PASS REVIEW_RESULT sidecars carrying failed P1 as a DET finding. These should be re-reviewed before their signed attestations are trusted for claim/close decisions:\n\n- `ruinable-priggish-silverfish` (`6ba6-ae90-28a6-4394`)\n- `operatic-melting-egg` (`5267-f026-0f2b-4c02`)\n- `hexadic-recognized-flea` (`ed6d-5448-4ff6-4b8a`)\n- `camoflage-delirious-dowitcher` (`cf19-d1e0-e817-4510`)\n- `earthly-wraithlike-urson` (`6194-8815-8ebb-42d0`)\n- `injurious-definable-badger` (`21fc-a459-e298-4c31`)\n- `enstatite-organic-geese` (`8f85-f170-1413-4040`)\n- `semidry-alien-nilgai` (`1157-5b58-b6fa-4710`)\n- `scratchy-leprous-galago` (`1128-505b-54ac-497f`)\n- `seraphic-taming-terrier` (`3ed6-b264-e1ae-41a0`)\n- `glad-monotonous-greatargus` (`d5c7-0d57-c3ab-4e93`)\n- `epidermic-commodious-opossum` (`34c2-8c41-1a12-4254`)\n- `unbeaten-tense-mosquito` (`2b16-9be0-a8f5-41d9`)\n- `compulsory-pernickety-mantis` (`e72e-259d-5ee7-4e73`)\n- `civil-electoral-lcont` (`751e-06f1-bb0b-464c`)\n\nScan method: local read-only traversal of `.tickets-tracker/*/*-REVIEW_RESULT.json` for `verdict == PASS` and a DET P1 finding containing `no standard ## Acceptance Criteria checklist`, then requiring a plan-review SIGNATURE event within the same review window. Duplicate reviews on the same ticket were collapsed to unique tickets above."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788383442525404151,"uuid":"bed35a76-cb7e-4adb-9e4f-ebb42bd0f56e"}